## API

`GET /api/Org/MisReport/CoPerformance`

| Param | Type | Required | Notes |
|---|---|---|---|
| `org_id` | int | Yes | |
| `branch_id` | int | Yes | Logged-in branch |
| `from_date` | date | Yes | `DD-MM-YYYY` or `YYYY-MM-DD` |
| `to_date` | date | Yes* | Must be ≥ `from_date`. *Blank = `from_date` |
| `report_branch_id` | int | No | Head office only. Blank / `0` = All Branches, `>0` = one branch |
| `co_id` | int | No | Blank = all, **`0` = Not Assigned**, `>0` = one Sahayika |
| `view` | string | No | `summary` (no rows), `sahayika` (default), `group`, `month` |

Examples:

```
# Sahayika-wise for a branch
/api/Org/MisReport/CoPerformance?org_id=1&branch_id=1&report_branch_id=2&from_date=01-03-2026&to_date=31-03-2026&view=sahayika
# Groups of one Sahayika
/api/Org/MisReport/CoPerformance?org_id=1&branch_id=2&from_date=01-03-2026&to_date=31-03-2026&co_id=11&view=group
# Month-wise trend of one Sahayika
/api/Org/MisReport/CoPerformance?org_id=1&branch_id=2&from_date=01-10-2025&to_date=31-03-2026&co_id=11&view=month
```

