No activity for the filters → `message: "No Data Found"`, `Summary` with zeros. All amounts / percentages are numbers (2 decimals), ids / counts are integers; `Coll_Pct`, `Avg_Loan_Size`, `Grade`, `Perf_Rank` may be `null`.

### `Summary` (always)

All metric fields from the table above, plus `From_Date`, `To_Date`, `Branch_Id` (`0` = all), `Branch_Name`, `Sahayika_Count` (active Sahayika in scope). `Grade` is the overall grade.

### `Rows` for `view = sahayika` (one row per Sahayika per branch)

| Field | Notes |
|---|---|
| `Branch_Id`, `Branch_Name` | Branch |
| `Key_Id` | `CO_Id` (`0` = Not Assigned) — send as `co_id` to drill down |
| `Key_Name`, `Key_Code` | Sahayika name / code |
| `Contact_Number`, `Is_Active` | From the Sahayika master (`null` for Not Assigned) |
| metrics | as in the table above, plus `Grade`, `Perf_Rank` |

Order: branch, Sahayika code; Not Assigned last in each branch.

### `Rows` for `view = group` (one row per group)

Same metric fields with `Key_Id` = `Group_Id`, `Key_Name` = `Group_Name (Group_No)`, `Key_Code` = `Group_No`, plus `CO_Id` (group's Sahayika, `0` = none) and `Collection_Day`. All groups of the selected Sahayika are listed (also those without loans). `Perf_Rank` ranks groups within the result.

### `Rows` for `view = month` (trend)

| Field | Notes |
|---|---|
| `Month_Key`, `Month_Name` | `2026-03`, `Mar 2026` |
| `Disb_Count`, `Disb_Amount` | Disbursed in the month |
| `Demand_Amount` | Installments falling due in the month |
| `Coll_Amount` | Collected in the month |
| `Coll_Vs_Due_Pct` | `Coll_Amount ÷ Demand_Amount × 100` (can exceed 100 when arrears / advances are collected) |

