## Errors

| HTTP | `message` | When |
|---|---|---|
| 400 | `Invalid data send` | Validation. `details` = `{ field: [messages] }` (e.g. `to_date` before `from_date`, invalid `view`) |
| 400 | `Error Found` | Server / database error. `details` = message |
| 401 | `Unauthenticated.` | Missing / expired token |

